    "bvTitle": "Boundary Value Analysis (BV)",
    "bvDesc": "A method that complements EC: values at the boundaries of equivalence classes are tested.",
    "bvPrinciple": "Errors most often occur at range boundaries, making BV one of the most effective test design methods.",
    "bvExample1": "For the «Valid age (0–120)» class boundaries: 0, 1, 119, 120.",
    "bvExample2": "For the «n ≥ 0» class in factorial: 0, 1 (lower boundary and next).",
